<title>USA: Arterial Vascular releases stent in Europe.</title>
<headline>Arterial Vascular releases stent in Europe.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA ROSA, Calif. 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Arterial Vascular Engineering Inc said it released a new coronary stent system in Germany and the U.K.</p>
<p>It also plans an October 1 release in four other countries in Europe.</p>
<p>It said the new stent is designed to optimize flexibility and features a smooth edge design that allows access to curved vessels. Stents are metal prostheses inserted into arteries after balloon angioplasty to prevent blockages.</p>
</text>
